  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Piloting the application of the 2021 Recommendation on the Ethics of Artificial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the face of major technological transformation of societies in Mozambique, SHS Maputo Office will focus on:
1. Establishes a set  of  values  in  line  with  the  promotion  and  protection  of  human  rights,  human  dignity, and environmental sustainability.
2. Advising and build capacities in Mozambique on understanding the implications of different areas of technology.
3. Building implementation tools for the 2017 Declaration of EAI in relation to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
